# BUGS

A bevel's light is fixed at the top left, and a gradient has two colours.
The class names are those of todhchai's widgets and apps.
A check's mark is a square, not a tick, since shapes have no strokes at an angle; a pop-up's arrow is rows of whole pixels.
The kit frame's digests are recorded on x86_64, and another architecture's floating point may round a pixel differently. The tests draw no theme's high-contrast variant yet.
